Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aac0ba36-a796-3012-bbd3-078e5fbba098.xml</text>
